<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" agent="SmartFine" version="24.0.0"><diagram id="page1" name="5. Network Diagram (Network Flow)"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2280" pageHeight="1330" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="n2" value="SmartFine: A Student Fines Monitoring and Management System" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#173A73;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="2200" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n3" value="Network Diagram (Network Flow)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#2E9D43;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="52" width="2200" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n4" value="Devices, servers, network equipment and the data flow between them" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#6B7689;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontStyle=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="78" width="2200" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n5" value="" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#173A73;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="106" width="2200" height="2" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n6" value="Users' devices (anywhere)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=8;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#173A73;fillColor=#F3FAF5;strokeColor=#4DA862;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="126" width="350" height="990" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n7" value="Internet and public services" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=8;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#173A73;fillColor=#F4F8FD;strokeColor=#5B7DB1;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="410" y="126" width="920" height="990" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n8" value="School network (the SmartFine server computer)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=8;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#173A73;fillColor=#FFFBF0;strokeColor=#D6B656;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1360" y="126" width="890" height="990" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n9" value="" style="shape=mxgraph.networks.mobile;html=1;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1B2437;fillColor=#DFF3E3;strokeColor=#4DA862;strokeWidth=2;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="174" y="314" width="62" height="92" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n10" value="&lt;b&gt;Student's phone&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;SmartFine app (Android APK or Expo Go)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=center;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1B2437;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="414" width="230" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n11" value="" style="shape=mxgraph.networks.mobile;html=1;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1B2437;fillColor=#E6DDF3;strokeColor=#8A6BB5;strokeWidth=2;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="174" y="544" width="62" height="92" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n12" value="&lt;b&gt;Fines Officer's phone&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;SmartFine app" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=center;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1B2437;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="644" width="230" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n13" value="" style="shape=mxgraph.networks.laptop;html=1;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1B2437;fillColor=#F8D7D7;strokeColor=#C75C5C;strokeWidth=2;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="157" y="787" width="96" height="66" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n14" value="&lt;b&gt;Administrator's computer&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;SmartFine web app in a browser" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=center;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1B2437;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="860" width="230" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n15" value="&lt;b style='font-size:16px'&gt;Internet&lt;/b&gt;" style="shape=mxgraph.networks.cloud;html=1;verticalLabelPosition=middle;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1B2437;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=2;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="655" y="510" width="290" height="180" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n16" value="&lt;b&gt;ngrok&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;tunnel service&lt;br&gt;(public HTTPS address)" style="shape=mxgraph.networks.cloud;html=1;verticalLabelPosition=middle;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1B2437;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;strokeWidth=2;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1025" y="535" width="210" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n17" value="" style="shape=mxgraph.networks.web_server;html=1;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1B2437;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;strokeWidth=2;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="765" y="227" width="70" height="86" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n18" value="&lt;b&gt;PayMongo&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;GCash payment gateway" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1B2437;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="850" y="250" width="300" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n19" value="" style="shape=mxgraph.networks.mail_server;html=1;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1B2437;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;strokeWidth=2;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="765" y="887" width="70" height="86" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n20" value="&lt;b&gt;Email service&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Gmail SMTP (one-time codes)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1B2437;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="850" y="910" width="300" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n21" value="" style="shape=mxgraph.networks.firewall;html=1;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1B2437;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=2;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1415" y="567" width="60" height="66" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n22" value="&lt;b&gt;Firewall&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;(Windows)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=center;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1B2437;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1385" y="640" width="120" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n23" value="" style="shape=mxgraph.networks.wireless_hub;html=1;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1B2437;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=2;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1571" y="573" width="78" height="54" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n24" value="&lt;b&gt;Router and&lt;br&gt;Wi-Fi access point&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=center;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1B2437;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1535" y="632" width="150" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n25" value="" style="shape=mxgraph.networks.switch;html=1;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1B2437;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=2;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1740" y="573" width="70" height="54" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n26" value="&lt;b&gt;Network switch&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=center;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1B2437;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1710" y="540" width="130" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n27" value="" style="shape=mxgraph.networks.server;html=1;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1B2437;fillColor=#DCE7F8;strokeColor=#5B7DB1;strokeWidth=2;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2003" y="550" width="74" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n28" value="&lt;b&gt;SmartFine server computer&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Node.js + Express API (port 3000)&lt;br&gt;Socket.IO live updates &amp;middot; ngrok agent" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=center;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1B2437;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1870" y="440" width="340" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n29" value="" style="shape=mxgraph.networks.pc;html=1;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1B2437;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=2;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1736" y="827" width="78" height="66" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n30" value="&lt;b&gt;Office computer&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Administrator on the school network" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=center;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1B2437;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1680" y="900" width="190" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n31" value="" style="shape=mxgraph.networks.storage;html=1;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1B2437;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;strokeWidth=2;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1857" y="924" width="66" height="72" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n32" value="&lt;b&gt;SQLite database&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;smartfine.db" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=center;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1B2437;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1825" y="1000" width="130" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n33" value="" style="shape=mxgraph.networks.storage;html=1;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1B2437;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;strokeWidth=2;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2007" y="924" width="66" height="72" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n34" value="&lt;b&gt;Uploads folder&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;pictures and evidence photos" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=center;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1B2437;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1970" y="1000" width="140" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n35" value="" style="shape=mxgraph.networks.storage;html=1;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1B2437;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;strokeWidth=2;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2152" y="924" width="66" height="72" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n36" value="&lt;b&gt;Backups folder&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;encrypted (AES-256)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=center;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1B2437;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2120" y="1000" width="130" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n37" value="HTTPS 443 + WSS" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;startArrow=classic;startFill=1;endArrow=classic;endFill=1;startSize=7;endSize=7;strokeColor=#2F5FB3;strokeWidth=2.5;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1B2437;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n9" target="n15"><mxGeometry x="-0.25" y="-16" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n38" value="HTTPS 443 + WSS" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;startArrow=classic;startFill=1;endArrow=classic;endFill=1;startSize=7;endSize=7;strokeColor=#2F5FB3;strokeWidth=2.5;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1B2437;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n11" target="n15"><mxGeometry x="-0.25" y="-14" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n39" value="HTTPS 443 + WSS" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;startArrow=classic;startFill=1;endArrow=classic;endFill=1;startSize=7;endSize=7;strokeColor=#2F5FB3;strokeWidth=2.5;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1B2437;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n13" target="n15"><mxGeometry x="-0.25" y="16" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n40" value="HTTPS 443 / WSS" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;startArrow=classic;startFill=1;endArrow=classic;endFill=1;startSize=7;endSize=7;strokeColor=#2F5FB3;strokeWidth=2.5;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1B2437;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n15" target="n16"><mxGeometry x="0" y="-26" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n41" value="Encrypted tunnel&lt;br&gt;(outward from the server)" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;startArrow=classic;startFill=1;endArrow=classic;endFill=1;startSize=7;endSize=7;strokeColor=#2F5FB3;strokeWidth=2.5;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1B2437;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n16" target="n21"><mxGeometry x="0" y="-38" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n42" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;startArrow=classic;startFill=1;endArrow=classic;endFill=1;startSize=7;endSize=7;strokeColor=#2E9D43;strokeWidth=2.5;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1B2437;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n21" target="n23"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n43" value="LAN" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;startArrow=classic;startFill=1;endArrow=classic;endFill=1;startSize=7;endSize=7;strokeColor=#2E9D43;strokeWidth=2.5;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1B2437;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n23" target="n25"><mxGeometry x="0" y="-18" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n44" value="Ethernet / Wi-Fi LAN" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;startArrow=classic;startFill=1;endArrow=classic;endFill=1;startSize=7;endSize=7;strokeColor=#2E9D43;strokeWidth=2.5;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1B2437;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n25" target="n27"><mxGeometry x="0" y="-26" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n45" value="LAN" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;startArrow=classic;startFill=1;endArrow=classic;endFill=1;startSize=7;endSize=7;strokeColor=#2E9D43;strokeWidth=2.5;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1B2437;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n25" target="n29"><mxGeometry x="0" y="20" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n46" value="HTTPS: checkout and refund requests;&lt;br&gt;signed webhooks come back" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;startArrow=classic;startFill=1;endArrow=classic;endFill=1;startSize=7;endSize=7;strokeColor=#2F5FB3;strokeWidth=2.5;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1B2437;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n15" target="n17"><mxGeometry x="0" y="190" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n47" value="SMTP over TLS (587)" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;startArrow=classic;startFill=1;endArrow=classic;endFill=1;startSize=7;endSize=7;strokeColor=#7A5BA6;strokeWidth=2.5;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1B2437;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n15" target="n19"><mxGeometry x="0" y="100" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n48" value="Parameterized SQL&lt;br&gt;(local file)" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;startArrow=classic;startFill=1;endArrow=classic;endFill=1;startSize=7;endSize=7;strokeColor=#B8962E;strokeWidth=2.5;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1B2437;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n27" target="n31"><mxGeometry x="0.55" y="-62" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n49" value="Files&lt;br&gt;(signed links)" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;startArrow=classic;startFill=1;endArrow=classic;endFill=1;startSize=7;endSize=7;strokeColor=#B8962E;strokeWidth=2.5;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1B2437;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n27" target="n33"><mxGeometry x="0.55" y="50" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n50" value="Daily&lt;br&gt;backup" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;startArrow=classic;startFill=1;endArrow=classic;endFill=1;startSize=7;endSize=7;strokeColor=#B8962E;strokeWidth=2.5;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1B2437;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n27" target="n35"><mxGeometry x="0.55" y="46" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n51" value="1" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#173A73;strokeColor=#173A73;fontColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="441" y="451" width="28" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n52" value="2" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#173A73;strokeColor=#173A73;fontColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="971" y="586" width="28" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n53" value="3" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#173A73;strokeColor=#173A73;fontColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1271" y="586" width="28" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n54" value="4" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#173A73;strokeColor=#173A73;fontColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1958" y="534" width="28" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n55" value="5" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#173A73;strokeColor=#173A73;fontColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="786" y="396" width="28" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n56" value="6" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#173A73;strokeColor=#173A73;fontColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="786" y="456" width="28" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n57" value="&lt;b&gt;Data flow, for example when a student pays a fine with GCash (numbers on the diagram)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1.  The student's phone sends an HTTPS request (and keeps a WSS connection for live updates) over the Internet to SmartFine's public ngrok address.&lt;br&gt;2.  The Internet delivers the request to ngrok's public HTTPS endpoint.&lt;br&gt;3.  ngrok forwards it through its encrypted tunnel, which the server computer opened outward, past the firewall and router to the SmartFine server.&lt;br&gt;4.  The server checks the session and role, reads and writes the SQLite database, stores photos and writes the encrypted backups on its own disk, and records the Log Trail.&lt;br&gt;5.  The server asks PayMongo (HTTPS) for a GCash checkout; the student pays on PayMongo's page.&lt;br&gt;6.  PayMongo sends a signed webhook back through the Internet and the same ngrok tunnel; the server verifies it, marks the fine PAID and pushes a live update to the phone. Codes are sent by email through Gmail (SMTP over TLS)." style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FAFBFD;strokeColor=#9AA5B5;fontColor=#1B2437;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="1140" width="1480" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n58" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Blue arrow = encrypted Internet traffic (HTTPS 443 / WSS).&lt;br&gt;Green arrow = school local network (LAN).&lt;br&gt;Purple arrow = email (SMTP over TLS).&lt;br&gt;Amber dashed arrow = files on the server computer's disk (database, uploads, backups).&lt;br&gt;Only the ngrok tunnel reaches the server from outside; the server opens it outward, so no port on the school router is opened.&lt;br&gt;The server also contacts PayMongo and Gmail through the router." style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FAFBFD;strokeColor=#9AA5B5;fontColor=#1B2437;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1540" y="1140" width="700" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>